 opening=[line('Bumble','We will establish why the lights failed. Nobody is to demonstrate it by touching the wiring.'),line('Victor','The vendor arrived. The room went dark. My entrance was ruined. Three connected tragedies.','Angry'),line('Oliver','Connected is exactly the question. Let us identify what was actually drawing power.','Pointing'),line('Bumble','Milo, give us your observations. Keep your conclusions on a separate plate.')],
