 exhibit('circuit_plan','Reception circuit plan','DIAGRAM','Stage circuit capacity: 2,300 W. The serving urn uses 1,500 W on that circuit.','The urn leaves 800 W of spare capacity. The vendor table is labelled BATTERY EQUIPMENT; the stage extension also feeds the presentation riser.',0,['CIRCUIT LIMIT / 2,300 W','Serving urn / 1,500 W','Spare capacity / 800 W','Riser socket shares stage circuit'],diagram='circuit'),
