 stage('Twelve missing minutes','Victor',0,'breaker_log',[testimony('The failure happened at 20:20, the moment the vendor arrived.','VICTOR: I remember a dark cloud. OLIVER: An emotional recollection is not a breaker timestamp.','Angry'),testimony('The fog machine was scheduled for the award presentation.','VICTOR: At twenty thirty-two. A majestic entrance requires precision.','Smug'),testimony('The serving urn was already operating before the speeches.','BRICK: One thousand five hundred watts. The circuit plan records it.')],[line('Oliver','The breaker remained healthy at 20:20. It tripped at 20:32:04, immediately after your scheduled effects cue.','Pointing'),line('Bumble','Enter the electrician\'s test and inspection. We require a cause, not merely a suspicious minute.'),line('Brick','The test reproduced the failure. Nobody touched a manual switch.'),line('Victor','I would prefer the word dramatic to the word overloaded.','Nervous')]),
