 exhibit('collection_policy','Cash collection policy','DOCUMENT','Security must collect sealed donations at 16:40 and use the night-deposit safe. Vendors may not handle donation-box keys.','An empty display box after the scheduled collection is expected. The money is meant to move into the secure deposit system, not remain on display.',0,['DAILY COLLECTION / 16:40','Responsible officer / SECURITY','Sealed envelopes to NIGHT SAFE','Donation-box key / D2']),
 exhibit('key_register','Borrowed-key register','DOCUMENT','Benny borrowed K4 at 16:10 and returned it at 16:45. K4 opens the catering cupboard. D2 remained with Officer Brick.','The alleged borrowed key cannot open the donation box. The register distinguishes K4, the catering cupboard key, from D2, the donation-box key.',1,['K4 / CATERING CUPBOARD','16:10 OUT / 16:45 RETURNED / BENNY','D2 / DONATION BOX','Custodian throughout / OFFICER BRICK']),
