 stage('A key to which lock?','Victor',1,'key_register',[testimony('Benny borrowed a courthouse key that afternoon.','VICTOR: Signed out at sixteen ten. At last, a signature that is not mine.'),testimony('That borrowed key opened the donation box.','VICTOR: It is marked K4. I did not consider that the number might matter.','Smug'),testimony('The collection policy reserves donation handling for security.','BRICK: The donation-box key is D2. I kept it on my duty ring.')],[line('Oliver','K4 opens the catering cupboard. D2 opens the donation box and remained with Brick. Your keys do not match.','Pointing'),line('Brick','I collected C17 at sixteen forty under the policy. The receipt was filed in security.'),line('Bumble','Enter the night-safe receipt and the bank confirmation. Trace the actual envelope.'),line('Benny','I borrowed a cupboard key to retrieve napkins. My most dangerous equipment is absorbent.')]),
